-- real SAA-C03 exam blueprint from certDetail["aws-saa"] (app/certifications/
-- [id]/page.tsx): Design Secure Architectures 30% (6 of 20), Design
-- Resilient Architectures 26% (5 of 20), Design High-Performing
-- Architectures 24% (5 of 20), Design Cost-Optimized Architectures 20%
-- (4 of 20). Every question checked against documented, stable AWS service
-- behavior — not recently-changed pricing specifics or console UI details
